abstract: >-
  Versioned, checksummed research corpus behind FiveLetterWords.io: a six-turn
  opener benchmark for all 14,855 accepted Wordle guesses, spoiler-safe puzzle
  difficulty rows (no answer words), one-slot trap families, first-turn feedback
  branches, opening-pair frontier, aggregate letter frequencies and repeats, and a
  Wordle #2000 fact sheet. Answer-history data through 2026-08-31. Independent
  research; not affiliated with or endorsed by The New York Times. Wordle is a
  trademark of The New York Times Company.
keywords:
  - Wordle
  - word games
  - opener rankings
  - puzzle difficulty
  - information theory
  - linguistics
